WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.333
The Dashboard groups shortcuts by task. Use Business Management for Customers, Catalog, and Events.

00:06.333 --> 00:10.167
Choose New Sale to start an invoice, a quick sale, or a quote.

00:10.167 --> 00:13.083
Use Reports to review sales and balances.

00:13.083 --> 00:17.750
Open Business Settings to manage your profile, workspace, and payment setup.

